    count end the turn BLOCKED/NOT_ESTABLISHED (VERIFIER_NOT_CONVERGING) with the
    attempt history attached. ENVIRONMENT, timed-out and skipped attempts are ignored.
    Threshold: NEXUS_VERIFIER_CONVERGENCE_ATTEMPTS (default 3).

